				<Content name="LinkedSource"><null></null></Content>
				<string name="Name">INSTRUCTIONS</string>
				<ProtectedString name="Source">--[[How to use:
First, ungroup the model this is in.
Now, take the bricks named &quot;One&quot;, &quot;Two&quot;, &quot;Three&quot;, and &quot;Four&quot;.
Those bricks are where the giant epicface might spawn.
Put them high in the air, above random locations.
Now, put the bricks named &quot;EpicFace&quot; and &quot;Badge&quot; into StarterGui. (THIS WILL HARM YOUR CHARACTER IN ANY WAY.)
Now, make the bricks &quot;One&quot;, &quot;Two&quot;, &quot;Three&quot;, and &quot;Four&quot; invisible.
And now, go into the script that&apos;s inside the part named &quot;Badge&quot;.
Find something in the script that says BadgeID. Change the 0 after it to the ID of the badge you&apos;re using.
And you&apos;re pretty much done.
]]
</ProtectedString>
			</Properties>
